&lt;p style="margin-left: 126px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;社外取締役(監査等委員)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E36751-000SuematsuHiroyukiMember">(注)3</jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E36751-000AramakiTomokoMember">

取締役


(監査等委員)

</jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E36751-000AramakiTomokoMember">荒牧知子</jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
